@startuml 03-abilities-combat
!pragma layout smetana
title Abilità e combattimento - Strategy

left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
hide circle

class "abilities/*.yaml" as AbilityYaml <<asset>>
class AbilityLoader <<Loader>>
class DataDrivenAbility
class AbilityFactory <<Registry>>
interface AbilityStrategy <<Strategy>>
class "DamageStrategy\nHealStrategy" as Strategies
class BattleModel <<Model>>

AbilityYaml --> AbilityLoader
AbilityLoader --> DataDrivenAbility
DataDrivenAbility --> AbilityFactory
AbilityFactory --> AbilityStrategy
AbilityStrategy <|.. Strategies
BattleModel --> DataDrivenAbility : usa abilità

note bottom of AbilityStrategy
Minimo: lo YAML sceglie una strategia eseguita in battaglia.
end note
@enduml
